      "value": "Please use the new Easy Anti-Cheat (EAC) whitelist feature to allow Shadow PC users back into VRChat.\n\n​For those of us on a budget, cloud computing is the only way to experience VRChat the way it was intended. My current hardware (Quest 2 and a basic laptop) can’t handle high-end PCVR worlds or games like Slashco—they lag or crash immediately.\n\n​Shadow PC is a paid, persistent service, not a \"throwaway\" VM used for cheating. Epic Games has now given developers the tools to whitelist specific services; please flip the switch so we can return to our communities!",
